    "spec": "A person's patrons now carry shares: 100.00 split equally among the patrons in the order they were\nnamed, each share rounded half to even to two decimals, with the remainder (100.00 minus the shares\nadded up) given to the first-named patron. The patrons cell shows each patron as <name> <share>,\nsorted by name, comma and space separated. Backing is now the sum over the patrons of the patron's\nfigure (their settled figures of the last 90 days, as before) times their share divided by 100,\nrounded half to even.\n",
    "prompt": "You are implementing ONE change to this application.\n\nFIRST read AGENTS.md \u2014 it states the working rules and how the app is tested, and sends you to\nDESIGN.md for the app's stack and conventions. Follow both.\n\nTHE CHANGE REQUEST:\nA person's patrons now carry shares: 100.00 split equally among the patrons in the order they were\nnamed, each share rounded half to even to two decimals, with the remainder (100.00 minus the shares\nadded up) given to the first-named patron. The patrons cell shows each patron as <name> <share>,\nsorted by name, comma and space separated. Backing is now the sum over the patrons of the patron's\nfigure (their settled figures of the last 90 days, as before) times their share divided by 100,\nrounded half to even.\n\nYour work is verified by an automated Playwright UI test already installed under e2e/specs/.\nRead that spec: it declares the exact data-testid anchors, values, test data and any audit\nrecords it expects \u2014 match them. Run `bin/e2e` to build the app, start it, and run the test as\nyou work; iterate until it passes. Change whatever the request needs across the app \u2014 its stored\ndata, its server and its front end. Do NOT edit bin/build, bin/start, bin/stop, bin/e2e,\nAGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, DESIGN.md, e2e/support/ or the test spec.\n"
  },
